### CrossVal — Multi-Rate Pricing Calculator API (HTTP examples)
### Phase 0: skeleton — controllers return hardcoded mocks with the shapes of SDD §5.3.
### Sentinel IDs:
###   :id = 000000000000000000000404 → 404 DOCUMENT_NOT_FOUND
###   :id = 000000000000000000000409 → 409 FINALIZED_DOCUMENT_IMMUTABLE
###
### Variable placeholder: set @token after a real signup/login (Phase 3+).

@host = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT


### ---------- Health ----------

### 200 OK — public
GET {{host}}/health


### ---------- Auth ----------

### 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "correcthorsebatterystaple"
}

### 409 EMAIL_ALREADY_REGISTERED — sentinel email pattern
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "taken+000000000000000000000409@example.com",
  "password": "correcthorsebatterystaple"
}

### 422 VALIDATION_ERROR — invalid email
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### 200 OK
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "correcthorsebatterystaple"
}


### ---------- Documents ----------

### 200 OK — list
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 201 Created
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample quote",
  "customer": "Acme Corp",
  "issueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "lines": [
    {
      "description": "Widget A",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPriceCents": 10000,
      "discount": { "type": "percent", "percent": 10 },
      "taxPercent": 5
    }
  ]
}

### 422 VALIDATION_ERROR — body with forbidden total field (BR-10)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad",
  "customer": "Acme",
  "issueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "grandTotalCents": 1
}

### 422 INVALID_DISCOUNT_SHAPE — discount with both fixed and percent keys (BR-2)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad",
  "customer": "Acme",
  "issueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "lines": [
    {
      "description": "x",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPriceCents": 100,
      "discount": { "type": "fixed", "amountCents": 5, "percent": 10 }
    }
  ]
}

### 422 INVALID_PERCENT — percent with more than 2 decimals
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad",
  "customer": "Acme",
  "issueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "lines": [
    {
      "description": "x",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPriceCents": 100,
      "taxPercent": 7.333
    }
  ]
}

### 200 OK — get one
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 404 DOCUMENT_NOT_FOUND — sentinel id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000404
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 OK — patch
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title"
}

### 422 STATUS_NOT_PATCHABLE — status in PATCH body (BR-13)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "finalized"
}

### 409 FINALIZED_DOCUMENT_IMMUTABLE — sentinel id
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000409
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "X"
}

### 204 No Content — delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 409 FINALIZED_DOCUMENT_IMMUTABLE — delete on finalized
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000409
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 201 Created — add line
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111/lines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Service fee",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPriceCents": 20000,
  "discount": { "type": "fixed", "amountCents": 2000 },
  "taxPercent": 0
}

### 200 OK — patch line
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111/lines/000000000000000000000aa1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 200 OK — delete line (returns full document, not 204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111/lines/000000000000000000000aa1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 OK — finalize
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 409 FINALIZED_DOCUMENT_IMMUTABLE — finalize sentinel
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000409/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 201 Created — duplicate
POST {{host}}/api/v1/documents/000000000000000000000111/duplicate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ---------- Reports ----------

### 200 OK — summary
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/summary?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 422 INVALID_DATE_RANGE — from > to
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/summary?from=2025-12-31&to=2025-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 422 INVALID_DATE_RANGE — missing from
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/summary?to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 422 INVALID_DATE — bad format
GET {{host}}/api/v1/reports/summary?from=2024-13-01&to=2025-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ---------- Error shape (sanity) ----------

### 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/v1/does-not-exist
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 UNAUTHENTICATED — (Phase 0 stub middleware injects a fake user; becomes 401 in Phase 3)
### Without Authorization header, in Phase 0 this still passes authMiddleware (stub), so the
### response comes from the controller. In Phase 3 the real middleware returns 401.